  "description": "MCPInvoke is a complete Model Context Protocol (MCP) server implementation for ASP.NET Core applications. Originally designed as a companion to MCPBuckle for tool execution, MCPInvoke now provides full MCP protocol support including tool discovery and execution. Version 1.5.0 updates to MCPBuckle 1.7.0 with critical fixes for [FromQuery] complex object detection and inheritance chain property walking, essential for LLM prompt management APIs with inheritance-based parameter structures.",
